{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3f482f55a9a8aa19","name":"Integrated Equipment","source":{"id":"source:reference-3f482f55a9a8aa19","title":"Integrated Equipment","revision":19691,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:25:55Z","sha256":"0806a905c663dd7102b86292858654293fdb6141c2ad977bbe2de18993211056","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19691","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Integrated%20Equipment&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3f482f55a9a8aa19","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["INTEGRATED EQUIPMENT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COST\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["UPGRADE POINT"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/UPGRADE_POINT"}," COST\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1 Slot\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["200\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2 Slots\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["500\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5 Slots\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10 Slots\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["An Integrated Equipment Upgrade attaches one piece of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," per Slot. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," must be three or more sizes smaller than the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," itself. For example, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," for a Medium character is Medium size, so it can mount ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," up to Diminutive size (such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Electrobinoculars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Electrobinoculars","referenceId":"reference:40949b820ee53ffd"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Glow Rod"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Glow_Rod","referenceId":"reference:1c8b9eaebeec7318"},", or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Medpac"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Medpac","referenceId":"reference:f89e0de3ab0ae989"},") or a weapon up to Small size (such as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:38dcc06542ba096c"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vibroblade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vibroblade","referenceId":"reference:4d5963781a5121d7"},").\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," is constantly ready for use and need not be drawn or prepared before being used. Once a suit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," is rigged for Integrated Equipment, it becomes increasingly easy to add new pieces of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," as built-in modules. As a result, prices and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Slot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Slot"}," costs are given for 1, 2, 5, and 10 Slots of Integrated Equipment (see above).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["It is easy to swap out the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," attached to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," with this Upgrade. A single piece of Integrated Equipment can be swapped out for a different piece of gear in 10 minutes with a DC 10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check. The price of any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," attached to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," is separate from the Integrated Equipment Upgrade cost.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
